==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|amphibole}}, coined by {{w|René Just Haüy}} from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἀμφίβολος||ambiguous}}, in reference to its many forms.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mineral}} Any of a large group of structurally similar [[hydrated]] double [[silicate]] [[minerals]], containing various combinations of [[sodium]], [[calcium]], [[magnesium]], [[iron]], and [[aluminium]]/[[aluminum]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|amphibolite}}

